		{
			dependencies: ["64ABEB1EF9F81EA4"]
			description: [
				"The &6Steam Separator&r functions as 5.3 &7LV &3Centrifuges&r in parallel! It requires an input of &9Steam&r through a &eSteam Hatch&r, but it uses only some Steam."
				""
				"While it can't process &9fluids&r, it's perfect for ore processing, letting you get the most out of your dusts and letting you not have to deal with washing your ores in a &3Cauldron&r."
			]
