					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Soldering Alloy"
			x: -27.125d
			y: 8.3125d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Your first &6HV&r circuit, formed from two &6Good Integrated Circuits&r, &6RAM&r, and &6Transistors&r, among other ingredients."
				""
				"As you'll realize is the pattern, it is expensive and unwieldy to make the first forms of each tier of circuits. Fortunately, you don't have to make many of them."
				""
				"&2Prioritize using these circuits to make things needed for unlocking the next theme of circuits, which require more infrastructure but are much cheaper to produce.&r Eventually each circuit tier through Tier Eight will have a Processor recipe instead of requiring Processor Assemblies, Supercomputers, or Mainframes."
			]
			id: "69430F07D7CB842D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "14C06D74490B230B"
