		{
			description: [
				"&3Circuit Assemblers&r are the linchpin of your factory, gating progression through the &6Circuits&r. "
				""
				"Each time you upgrade to a new voltage of Circuit Assembler, you will be able to craft more advanced &ethemes&r of circuits. These use more complex ingredients and require new infrastructure to be in place, but are more efficient to craft overall than the same tier of circuit from the prior theme."
				""
				"&2The LV Circuit Assembler allows you to make Electronic Circuits far more easily."
				""
				"The circuit progression is largely based on native GTm progression, with a few minor changes to reflect the progression of this pack better.&r Check out the &bProgression quest book tab&r to see the flow of circuit progression."
			]
			id: "267B045593379C52"
			rewards: [{
				id: "47EC1D84F8FC8282"
				item: "kubejs:moni_quarter"
				type: "item"
			}]
