			}]
			title: "&2Phosphorus Doped Silicon Boule"
			x: -17.25d
			y: 3.25d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"This &3Personal Shrinking Device&r can grow or shrink your size."
				""
				"With the device in-hand, open its GUI with &8Right-click&r and use the buttons to specify a factor to scale your size by. &8Shift-Right-click&r to activate."
